function PartnerSummary({extra={},access}:{extra?:any,access:string}){const image=(id:string)=>'/api/document/'+encodeURIComponent(id)+'?inline=1&access='+encodeURIComponent(access);return <div style={{marginBottom:24}}>{extra.sellerName&&<div className="next-action">{extra.sellerLogoDocument&&<img src={image(extra.sellerLogoDocument)} alt="Logo du vendeur" style={{width:72,height:72,objectFit:'contain'}}/>}<div><p className="eyebrow">Entreprise {extra.sellerRole||'vendeuse'}</p><h3>{extra.sellerName}</h3><p>{extra.sellerAddress}</p><p>{extra.sellerContact}</p><small>Achat auprès de cette entreprise · suivi logistique sur notre plateforme.</small></div></div>}{extra.productPhotoDocument&&<img src={image(extra.productPhotoDocument)} alt="Photographie de votre marchandise fournie par l’agence" style={{display:'block',width:'100%',maxHeight:360,objectFit:'contain',borderRadius:16,background:'#f2f6f6',margin:'16px 0'}}/>}{extra.clientInformation&&<p style={{whiteSpace:'pre-wrap'}}>{extra.clientInformation}</p>}</div>;}
function Field({label,name,required=true,type='text',defaultValue='',placeholder=''}:{label:string,name:string,required?:boolean,type?:string,defaultValue?:string,placeholder?:string}){return <label>{tr(label)}{required&&<span className="required"> *</span>}<SuggestedInput name={name} type={type} step={type==='number'?'any':undefined} required={required} defaultValue={defaultValue} placeholder={placeholder} maxLength={400}/></label>;}
function Category({defaultValue="Véhicule"}:{defaultValue?:string}){return <label>{tr("Type d’envoi")}<span className="required">*</span><select name="category" defaultValue={defaultValue}><option value="Véhicule">{tr("Véhicule")}</option><option value="Moto">{tr("Moto")}</option><option value="Marchandise">{tr("Marchandise")}</option></select></label>;}
function FormError({error}:{error:string}){return error?<p className="form-error" role="alert">{tr(error)}</p>:null;}
function CreateForm({onSuccess}:{onSuccess:(r:Row)=>void}){const [step,setStep]=useState(1),[saved,setSaved]=useState<Row>({}),[error,setError]=useState(''),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false);return <><div className="form-steps">{['Client & envoi','Trajet','Vérification'].map((s,i)=><span className={step===i+1?'active':''} key={s}><b>{i+1}</b>{s}</span>)}</div><form className="form" key={step} onSubmit={async e=>{e.preventDefault();const b:any={...saved,...Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.currentTarget).entries())};setSaved(b);setError('');if(step<3){setStep(step+1);return;}setBusy(true);try{const file=b.purchaseInvoice;if(file instanceof File&&file.size){if(file.size>10*1024*1024)throw new Error('Facture d’achat limitée à 10 Mo.');const sig=Array.from(new Uint8Array(await file.slice(0,8).arrayBuffer())).map(v=>v.toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('');if(!sig.startsWith('25504446')&&!sig.startsWith('ffd8ff')&&!sig.startsWith('89504e470d0a1a0a'))throw new Error('Facture d’achat : PDF, JPG ou PNG requis.');}const payload=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(b).filter(([k,v])=>k!=='purchaseInvoice'&&!(v instanceof File)));const r=await api('shipments',{...payload,origin:[b.origin,b.originCountry].filter(Boolean).join(', '),destination:[b.destination,b.destinationCountry].filter(Boolean).join(', ')});if(file instanceof File&&file.size){const form=new FormData();form.set('file',file);form.set('kind','Facture d’achat');form.set('shared',b.sharePurchaseInvoice?'true':'false');try{await uploadPrivateFile(file,{shipmentId:r.id,kind:'Facture d’achat',shared:!!b.sharePurchaseInvoice});}catch(e:any){r.warning='Dossier créé. Import de la facture à reprendre : '+e.message;}}try{const pf=new FormData();for(const [key,value] of Object.entries(b))if(typeof value==='string'||value instanceof File)pf.set(key,value);const partner=await collectPartnerFields(pf,r.id);await api('shipments/'+r.id+'/details',{...payload,...partner,version:0});}catch(e:any){r.warning=[r.warning,'Dossier créé. Vendeur et images à compléter depuis Achat, VIN et remise : '+e.message].filter(Boolean).join(' ');}onSuccess(r);}catch(err:any){setError(err.message);} finally{setBusy(false);}}}>{step===1?<><div className="form-grid"><Field label={tr("Nom du client")} name="client" defaultValue={saved.client}/><Field label={tr("Téléphone ou courriel")} name="contact" required={false} defaultValue={saved.contact}/></div><Field label={tr("Description de la marchandise")} name="item" placeholder={tr("Ex. Toyota Corolla 2020")} defaultValue={saved.item}/><div className="form-grid"><Field label={tr("Référence d’achat externe")} name="purchaseReference" required={false} defaultValue={saved.purchaseReference}/><Field label={tr("Première facture d’achat")} name="firstInvoiceReference" required={false} defaultValue={saved.firstInvoiceReference}/></div><Field label={tr("VIN du véhicule (si connu)")} name="vin" required={false} defaultValue={saved.vin}/><Field label={tr("Courriel pour les notifications")} name="email" type="email" required={false} defaultValue={saved.email}/><Category defaultValue={saved.category}/><PartnerFields data={saved}/><h3>{tr("Prix du véhicule seul")}</h3><p className="tiny muted">{tr("Facultatif. Transport et transit non inclus, facturés par prestation. Les montants clients seront USD et GNF.")}</p><Field label={tr("Prix interne du véhicule en CFA")} name="vehicleBase" type="number" required={false} defaultValue={saved.vehicleBase}/><div className="form-grid"><Field label={tr("USD pour 1 CFA")} name="vehicleUsdRate" type="number" required={false} defaultValue={saved.vehicleUsdRate}/><Field label={tr("GNF pour 1 USD")} name="vehicleGnfRate" type="number" required={false} defaultValue={saved.vehicleGnfRate}/></div><Field label={tr("Source des taux du prix d’achat")} name="rateSource" required={false} defaultValue={saved.rateSource}/><Field label={tr("Date des taux du prix d’achat")} name="rateDate" type="date" required={false} defaultValue={saved.rateDate}/></>:step===2?<><div className="form-grid"><Field label={tr("Ville ou port de départ")} name="origin" required={false} defaultValue={saved.origin}/><Field label={tr("Ville ou port de destination")} name="destination" required={false} defaultValue={saved.destination}/></div><div className="form-grid"><Country label={tr("Pays de départ")} name="originCountry" defaultValue={saved.originCountry}/><Country label={tr("Pays de destination")} name="destinationCountry" defaultValue={saved.destinationCountry}/></div><Field label={tr("Lieu de remise souhaité")} name="delivery" required={false} placeholder={tr("Port, aéroport ou adresse précise")} defaultValue={saved.delivery}/><Field label={tr("Créneau de remise souhaité")} name="deliverySlot" required={false} defaultValue={saved.deliverySlot}/><Field label={tr("Conteneur ou lot")} name="container" required={false} defaultValue={saved.container}/><Field label={tr("Arrivée estimée")} name="eta" type="date" required={false} defaultValue={saved.eta}/><p className="tiny muted">{tr("Vous pourrez ajouter autant d’escales que nécessaire après la création.")}</p></>:<><div className="review"><p><span>{tr("Client")}</span><strong>{saved.client}</strong></p><p><span>{tr("Contact")}</span><strong>{saved.contact}</strong></p><p><span>{tr("Marchandise")}</span><strong>{saved.item}</strong></p><p><span>{tr("Trajet")}</span><strong>{[saved.origin,saved.originCountry].filter(Boolean).join(", ")} → {[saved.destination,saved.destinationCountry].filter(Boolean).join(", ")}</strong></p><p><span>{tr("Arrivée estimée")}</span><strong>{saved.eta?date(saved.eta):'Non définie'}</strong></p></div><label>{tr('Facture d’achat authentique (facultative)')}<input name="purchaseInvoice" type="file" accept="application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png"/></label><label className="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="sharePurchaseInvoice"/>{tr('Partager la facture d’achat avec le client')}</label><p className="tiny muted">{tr("Le dossier sera enregistré. Aucune réception ou étape de transport ne sera inventée.")}</p></>}<FormError error={error}/><div className="form-actions">{step>1&&<button type="button" className="btn secondary" onClick={()=>setStep(step-1)}>{tr("Retour")}</button>}<button className="btn primary" disabled={busy}>{tr(busy?'Enregistrement…':step===3?'Créer l’expédition':'Continuer')}<ArrowRight size={17}/></button></div></form></>;}
function QuoteForm({onSuccess,signedIn,initialCategory,onOpenLogin}:{onSuccess:()=>void,signedIn:boolean,initialCategory:string,onOpenLogin?:()=>void}){const [busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState('');return <form className="form" onSubmit={async e=>{e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);setError('');try{await api('requests',Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.currentTarget).entries()));onSuccess();}catch(err:any){setError(err.message);}finally{setBusy(false);}}}><div className="form-grid"><Field label={tr("Votre nom")} name="name"/><Field label={tr("Téléphone ou courriel")} name="contact"/></div><Category defaultValue={initialCategory}/><div className="form-grid"><Field label={tr("Départ")} name="origin"/><Field label={tr("Destination")} name="destination"/></div><Field label={tr("Lieu de remise souhaité (port, aéroport ou adresse)")} name="deliveryAddress" required={false}/><Field label={tr("Pays et ville de remise")} name="deliveryCountry" required={false}/><Field label={tr("Créneau souhaité")} name="deliverySlot" required={false}/><p className="tiny muted">{tr("L’agence doit confirmer la disponibilité du service et les frais avant engagement.")}</p><label>{tr("Précisions")}<textarea name="note" rows={3} maxLength={1500} placeholder={tr("Modèle, quantité, date souhaitée…")}/></label><FormError error={error}/><label className="form-trap" aria-hidden="true">Website<input name="website" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete="off"/></label><button className="btn primary" disabled={busy}>{tr(busy?'Enregistrement…':'Enregistrer ma demande')}<ArrowRight size={17}/></button></form>;}
function EventForm({detail,rows,onSuccess}:{detail:Row,rows:Row[],onSuccess:(r:Row)=>void}){const [planned,setPlanned]=useState(false),[type,setType]=useState('En transport'),[publish,setPublish]=useState(true),[bulk,setBulk]=useState(false),[ids,setIds]=useState<string[]>([]),[busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState(''),[preview,setPreview]=useState<Row|null>(null);const siblings=rows.filter(r=>r.container===detail.shipment.container&&r.id!==detail.shipment.id);const localDate=()=>{const d=new Date();return new Date(d.getTime()-d.getTimezoneOffset()*60000).toISOString().slice(0,16);};return <form className="form" onSubmit={async e=>{e.preventDefault();setError('');if(!preview){const b=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.currentTarget).entries());setPreview({...b,date:new Date(String(b.date)).toISOString(),type,planned,published:publish,bulk,ids,version:detail.shipment.version});return;}setBusy(true);try{onSuccess(await api('shipments/'+detail.shipment.id+'/events',preview));}catch(err:any){setError(err.message);setPreview(null);}finally{setBusy(false);}}}>{preview?<><p className="eyebrow">{tr("APERÇU AVANT ENREGISTREMENT")}</p><div className="event-preview"><Badge status={preview.type}/><h3>{preview.place}</h3><p>{date(preview.date,true)}</p><p>{preview.note||'Aucun commentaire ajouté.'}</p><small>{tr(preview.planned?'Prévision':'Confirmation')} • {tr(preview.published?'Visible par le client':'Brouillon interne')}</small></div>{preview.bulk&&<p className="tiny">{tr("Cette étape concernera ce dossier et")}{ids.length} {tr("autre(s) dossier(s) sélectionné(s).")}</p>}</>:<><div className="segmented"><button type="button" className={!planned?'active':''} onClick={()=>setPlanned(false)}>{tr("Étape confirmée")}</button><button type="button" className={planned?'active':''} onClick={()=>setPlanned(true)}>{tr("Prévision")}</button></div><label>{tr("Étape")}<select value={type} onChange={e=>setType(e.target.value)}>{eventTypes.map(t=><option key={t} value={t}>{tr(t)}</option>)}</select></label><div className="form-grid"><Field name="place" label={tr("Lieu")}/><Field name="date" label={planned?'Date prévue':'Date réelle'} type="datetime-local" defaultValue={localDate()}/></div><label>{tr("Moyen de transport")}<select name="mode"><option value="Maritime">{tr("Maritime")}</option><option value="Aérien">{tr("Aérien")}</option><option value="Terrestre">{tr("Terrestre")}</option><option value="Combiné">{tr("Combiné")}</option></select></label><div className="form-grid"><Field label={tr("Latitude")} name="lat" type="number" required={false}/><Field label={tr("Longitude")} name="lng" type="number" required={false}/></div><p className="tiny muted">{tr("Coordonnées de la position confirmée ou prévue. Laissez vide si inconnues.")}</p><Field name="source" label={tr("Source de l’information")} defaultValue="Agence"/><label>{tr(type==='Livré'?'Référence ou preuve de remise *':'Commentaire visible par le client')}<textarea name="note" rows={3} maxLength={1500} required={type==='Livré'} placeholder={tr("Une information courte et utile…")}/></label><label className="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" checked={publish} onChange={e=>setPublish(e.target.checked)}/> {tr("Publier sur le suivi client après vérification")}</label>{siblings.length>0&&type!=='Livré'&&<div className="bulk"><label className="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" checked={bulk} onChange={e=>setBulk(e.target.checked)}/> {tr("Appliquer à d’autres dossiers du conteneur")}{detail.shipment.container}</label>{bulk&&siblings.map(r=><label className="checkbox" key={r.id}><input type="checkbox" checked={ids.includes(r.id)} onChange={e=>setIds(e.target.checked?[...ids,r.id]:ids.filter(x=>x!==r.id))}/>{r.item} • {r.client}</label>)}</div>}</>}<FormError error={error}/><div className="form-actions">{preview&&<button type="button" className="btn secondary" onClick={()=>setPreview(null)}>{tr("Modifier")}</button>}<button className="btn primary" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Enregistrement…':preview?(publish?'Confirmer la publication':'Enregistrer le brouillon'):'Vérifier l’étape'}<Check size={17}/></button></div></form>;}
function EtaForm({detail,onSuccess}:{detail:Row,onSuccess:()=>void}){const [busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState('');return <form className="form" onSubmit={async e=>{e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);setError('');try{await api('shipments/'+detail.shipment.id+'/eta',{...Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.currentTarget).entries()),version:detail.shipment.version});onSuccess();}catch(err:any){setError(err.message);}finally{setBusy(false);}}}><p className="muted">{tr("Estimation actuelle :")}{detail.shipment.eta?date(detail.shipment.eta):'Non définie'}{tr(". Une arrivée estimée reste distincte d’une confirmation.")}</p><Field label={tr("Nouvelle arrivée estimée")} name="eta" type="date" required={false} defaultValue={detail.shipment.eta}/><Field label={tr("Motif de la révision")} name="reason" placeholder={tr("Ex. nouvelle estimation reçue du transporteur")}/><FormError error={error}/><button className="btn primary" disabled={busy}>{tr(busy?'Enregistrement…':'Enregistrer la révision')}<Check size={17}/></button></form>;}
